---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="About Build Your Business | Practical Business Guidance" 
    description="Learn about Build Your Business: an evidence-based, practical guide to starting, managing, and scaling a real business without hype."
>
    <div class="about-page">
        <!-- 1. HERO SECTION -->
        <header class="page-header">
            <div class="hero-bg-glow"></div>
            <div class="container reveal">
                <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT BUILD YOUR BUSINESS</span>
                <h1>Real business education<br/><span class="text-gradient">without the hype</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    Practical, evidence-based frameworks to help aspiring founders and small business owners start lean, systemize operations, and build profitable companies.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. MISSION & THE MISSING MIDDLE -->
        <section class="about-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="editorial-intro reveal">
                    <span class="intro-label">OUR MISSION</span>
                    <p>
                        Most business content online falls into two extremes: dry academic theory with little practical utility, or aggressive "get-rich-quick" hype created to sell expensive courses.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Build Your Business</strong> exists to deliver the missing middle: actionable, structured education at the intersection of <strong>Business Strategy, Management Systems, and Modern Technology</strong>. We believe building a sustainable business is not about luck or intuition—it is an engineering discipline of problem discovery, validation, sound unit economics, and systematic execution.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. WHO THIS IS FOR -->
        <section class="about-section bg-alt">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header text-center reveal">
                    <span class="eyebrow">TARGET AUDIENCE</span>
                    <h2 class="section-title">Built for builders and operators</h2>
                    <p class="section-desc">
                        Whether you are testing your first idea or looking to systemize an existing operation, our guides are written for action.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="audience-grid">
                    <div class="card audience-card reveal">
                        <div class="card-num">01</div>
                        <h3>Aspiring Founders</h3>
                        <p>
                            You have an idea but limited capital. We show you how to start with little or no money, validate demand before building, and land your first paying customer with minimal risk.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card audience-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                        <div class="card-num">02</div>
                        <h3>Freelancers & Solo Operators</h3>
                        <p>
                            You have valuable skills but are trapped trading hours for dollars. We help you package your expertise into productized services, build client pipelines, and improve your margins.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card audience-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
                        <div class="card-num">03</div>
                        <h3>Small Business Owners</h3>
                        <p>
                            You already have customers, but operations feel chaotic. We provide frameworks for Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), software automation, and key performance indicators (KPIs).
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. CORE PRINCIPLES -->
        <section class="about-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header text-center reveal">
                    <span class="eyebrow">OUR PRINCIPLES</span>
                    <h2 class="section-title">How we approach business</h2>
                    <p class="section-desc">
                        Four core principles that guide every guide, framework, and article we publish.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="principles-grid">
                    <div class="card principle-card reveal">
                        <div class="principle-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Evidence Over Optimism</h3>
                        <p>
                            Don't validate ideas with wishful thinking. Treat every business idea as a hypothesis to be rigorously tested with real customer feedback and early pre-orders before investing time and money.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card principle-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                        <div class="principle-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Start Lean & Resourceful</h3>
                        <p>
                            Begin with low-overhead service models and simple MVPs. Substitute sweat equity and resourcefulness for heavy initial capital, keeping your burn rate near zero while you learn.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card principle-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
                        <div class="principle-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"></line><line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"></line></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Systems Enable Freedom</h3>
                        <p>
                            A real business is a machine designed to function reliably without constant owner intervention. We focus on documented processes, clear workflows, and modern software tools.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card principle-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
                        <div class="principle-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Focus on Unit Economics</h3>
                        <p>
                            Revenue without profit is a vanity metric. We prioritize sustainable margins, transparent pricing models, and cash flow positivity from the earliest stages of growth.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. CALL TO ACTION -->
        <section class="about-cta bg-alt">
            <div class="container text-center reveal">
                <h2>Ready to start building?</h2>
                <p class="section-desc">
                    Explore our in-depth guides covering ideation, low-cost starting, validation, and practical business planning.
                </p>
                <div class="cta-actions">
                    <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-primary">Browse All Articles</a>
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">Back to Homepage</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>

<script>
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
            entries.forEach(entry => {
                if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                    entry.target.classList.add('active');
                }
            });
        }, { threshold: 0.1 });
        
        document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
    });
</script>

<style>
    .about-page {
        background-color: var(--color-bg);
        min-height: 100vh;
        position: relative;
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 var(--space-3);
    }

    .text-center {
        text-align: center;
    }

    /* Page Header / Hero */
    .page-header {
        position: relative;
        padding: var(--space-16) 0 var(--space-12);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(11, 17, 32, 0.02) 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.05) 50%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.07) 100%);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-bg-glow {
        position: absolute;
        top: -40%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 800px;
        height: 600px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
    }

    .page-header .container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 800px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-brand-accent);
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    }

    .page-header h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.75rem);
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.15;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: var(--color-brand-primary);
        margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }

    .text-gradient {
        background: var(--gradient-accent);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
        font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0 auto;
        max-width: 680px;
    }

    /* Sections */
    .about-section {
        padding: var(--space-12) 0;
        position: relative;
    }

    .bg-alt {
        background-color: var(--color-bg-alt);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .section-header {
        margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    }

    .section-title {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-brand-primary);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .section-desc {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Editorial Intro Box */
    .editorial-intro {
        max-width: 840px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Audience Grid */
    .audience-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-6);
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .audience-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }
    }

    .audience-card {
        padding: var(--space-6);
        background: var(--color-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .card-num {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-brand-accent);
        background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }

    .audience-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--color-brand-primary);
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .audience-card p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* Principles Grid */
    .principles-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-6);
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .principles-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
    }

    .principle-card {
        padding: var(--space-6);
        background: var(--color-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }

    .principle-icon {
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        background: var(--color-info-bg);
        color: var(--color-brand-accent);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }

    .principle-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--color-brand-primary);
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .principle-card p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* Call to Action */
    .about-cta {
        padding: var(--space-12) 0;
    }

    .about-cta h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
        color: var(--color-brand-primary);
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .cta-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: var(--space-3);
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: var(--space-6);
    }
</style>
